<title>USA: ValueVision to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>ValueVision to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValueVision International Inc said Tuesday its board of directors has approved a repurchase of up to $10 million of the company's common stock.  </p>
<p>Under the plan, which as authorized after the direct marketing company completed a previous $10 million stock repurchase program, shares will be purchased from time to time in the open market and through negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>ValueVision shares were up 1/16 at 4-1/2 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
